}", "reasoning_content": "Okay, let's tackle this problem. So, the user is a high school junior who stayed up all night playing a new video game instead of doing homework. Now they have to decide whether to confess to the teacher or make up an excuse. The JSON answer needs to be either 1 or 2 with a decision statement and reasoning. Let's follow the steps.

