}", "reasoning_content": "Okay, so I need to work through this emotional dilemma using the three-step workflow. Let me start by understanding the situation. The person has been hiding their true self from their family for years, and now they're with a partner who loves them authentically. They're feeling torn between coming out to their family (action 1) and staying in the closet (action 2). The key is to analyze the facts, both actions, and the ethical/emotional tradeoffs.

