}", "reasoning_content": "Okay, I need to tackle this emotional dilemma. Let me start by understanding the situation. The person has a friend who's struggling with addiction. They've been supporting them through relapses, but it's taking a toll on their own well-being. Now, they're torn between continuing to support or stepping back.

